# ADR-0099: Widget artifact class (fixture)

**Status:** accepted

## Context

An inert decision record. Nothing outside `tools/governance/fixtures/delta/`
reads it.

## Decision

The `widget` class advances to schema epoch 2: `kind` becomes required, which
invalidates every instance that omitted it.

## Compatibility

The per-artifact-class compatibility statement for the `widget` class is
`Revalidate`: every stored instance must be re-checked before it is reused as
evidence. Estimated invalidation blast radius: the fixture corpus only.
